  "raw_text": "I might opt just for more chicken as opposed to having fries. And I usually do get a soft drink. And soft drink, I would get like a Diet Coke or a Diet Pepsi. Agent: Thank you for sharing your usual pairings: buffalo sauce if it's not spicy, fries (though sometimes you prefer more chicken), and a diet soft drink. Now, thinking about the opposite, what would you absolutely never pair with your favorite fried chicken, and why? User: What would I never pair with my fried chicken? I think... Agent: Please take your time. User: ... Agent: Please speak when you're ready. User: I'm honestly not too sure what I would never pair with my fried chicken because I think that, you know, I sort of sometimes do all sorts of things. I might add a sandwich. Might add a salad. I mean, I suppose that, you know, I'm not going to have fried chicken with a fancier meal like, I don't know, some sort of nice pasta or ribs or something like that. So, yeah, if it's fried chicken, then I usually go full out in",
